ness information databases.</p></div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<div>\n    <div class=\"s-lib-box s-lib-border-round s-lib-box-idx-guide-list\">\n        <div class=\"s-lib-box-content\">\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-badges s-lg-gmeta pull-right s-lg-small s-lib-color-lt-grey\">\n                <div class=\"s-lg-icons pad-left-sm\"><ul class=\"\"><li><a href=\"http://www.library.ucla.edu/service/campus-access\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Requires UCLA authentication\" class=\"s-lg-icon\" src=\"//d2jv02qf7xgjwx.cloudfront.net/sites/705/icons/983/key-newblue-transp.gif\"/><i class=\"fa fa-fw fa-external-link \" \n    aria-hidden=\"true\"\n           title=\"This link opens in a new window\"\n   ></i><span class=\"sr-only\">This link opens in a new window</span></a> </li></ul></div>\n                                                                            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-gtitle\" >\n                                <a  target=&quot;_blank&quot;  href=\"http://www.researchsource.amdigital.co.uk/WW2Studies\" onclick=\"return springSpace.springTrack.trackLink({link: this,_st_type_id: '16',_st_content_id: '51849256',_st_inc_return: this});\">\n                                                                World War Two Studies\n                                                        </a>\n                                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-description\">Primary sources, offering insight into many aspects of the World War II conflict, including government policy, the war in the Pacific, and the war in Europe. Sources include the records of the Special Operations Executive; and private papers of American General Robert L Eichelberger, from the Pacific war.</div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","experts":"<div class=\"margin-bottom-xlg\"><div class=\"s-lib-public-side-header\"><h2 class=\"pad-bottom-sm\">Government & Law Expe